  "translation": "Elisha tun sigilen don a so kɔnɔ, ani mɔgɔkɔrɔbaw sigilen don ni a ye; kɔrɔfanta ye ciden dɔ ci a ma; kabini ciden in ma na fɔlɔ, Elisha y'a fɔ mɔgɔkɔrɔbaw ye ko: Aw ye bɔn wa, masakɛden bɔngotigɛbaga in ye mɔgɔ ci ka ne ka ⟨את⟩ kun bɔ? Aw y'ɲɛ: ni ciden in na, aw ye da lagbu, aw kɛ o da la ⟨a⟩. Yala a matigi ka sen kan tɛ a kɔ fɛ wa?",
